Get ready to be part of the most exciting global youth sporting event!
The Youth Olympic Games is a multi-sport event for young athletes, which celebrates sports and 
international friendship. The upcoming edition of the Youth Olympic Games will be in Gangwon in 
January 2024, and you have a chance to be a part of it!
Olympic Broadcasting Services (OBS), the organisation responsible for bringing the magic of the 
Games to screens worldwide, is looking for students or recent grads interested in sports, broadcasting 
or event management to join their team. This is a unique chance to participate in the Winter Youth 
Olympic Games Gangwon 2024 as part of the media crew! 
Imagine learning from the best in the industry, gaining hands-on experience, and working alongside 
professionals who make the Olympic Games come alive on television. As part of the Youth Broadcast 
Experience programme, you'll have the opportunity to get a paid job  delivering this global spectacle 
viewers worldwide.
Apply now and mark your calendars for January 2024! 
